00:50:03.000 --> 00:50:43.000
Pam married Ryan in 1989 and he became a stepfather to Pam's young son. The couple went on to have three children together. Pam was the family breadwinner working to support the six of them while Ryan home-schooled their children. Pam wasn't happy with her children being educated at home but Ryan was a controlling husband and she had a little say in the matter. The more time that passed, the less Pam felt able to tell the truth. She did love Ryan despite what he'd done.
帕姆于1989年与瑞恩结婚，瑞恩成了帕姆年幼儿子的继父。此后，两人又育有三个孩子。帕姆是家里的顶梁柱，工作养活他们六口人，而瑞恩则在家教导他们的孩子。帕姆并不乐意让孩子们在家接受教育，但瑞恩是个控制欲极强的丈夫，在这件事上她没有什么发言权。时间过得越久，帕姆越觉得无法说出真相了。尽管瑞恩做了那种事，她确实还是爱他的。

61
00:50:43.000 --> 00:51:32.000
She was also terrified that if she revealed what had happened after years and then decades of lying, she could lose her children or wind up in prison. So she stayed married to Ryan for 24 years. Finally though, the pressure became too much to bear. When the cold case unit started looking into the brink homicides Pam started to feel that she couldn't hold everything she knew inside anymore. It was like a heavy burden on her shoulders weighing them down. After her first interview with the cold case detectives in October 2012
她也感到无比恐惧：如果把多年的谎言乃至几十年后的真相揭露出来，她可能会失去自己的孩子，或者锒铛入狱。因此，她和瑞恩保持了24年的婚姻。然而最终，这种压力变得让人难以承受。当冷案调查组开始调查布里姆家的谋杀案时，帕姆开始觉得她再也无法将所知的一切都憋在心里了。这就像是一副沉重的担子压在她的双肩上，让她透不过气来。在2012年10月她首次接受冷案侦探的面谈之后，

62
00:51:32.000 --> 00:52:08.000
when she revealed that the alibi Ryan had given was false, Ryan was angry with her. He called her after his own interview and yelled, I can't believe you threw me under the bus. Then he started ranting that the detectives must have bullied her. Pam didn't agree with this accusation. Her distress was obvious to detectives Blakely and Ripper. She cried constantly while describing how Ryan had taken her to see Gayle and Rick's bodies.
她透露瑞恩提供的不在场证明是假的，这让瑞恩对她感到非常愤怒。他在接受完自己的面谈后打电话给她并大喊道：“我真不敢相信你把我当成替罪羊抛弃了。”然后他开始咆哮，坚信是侦探们恐吓并逼迫了她。帕姆并不认同这种指控。侦探布莱克利和里珀一眼就能看出她的痛苦。她在描述瑞恩如何带她去看盖尔和里克的尸体时，一直在不停地哭泣。

63
00:52:08.000 --> 00:52:57.000
What was also obvious was the fact that Ryan was desperately trying to contact her. Throughout the entire interview, Pam's phone had been pinging with calls and messages from her husband who was frantically attempting to reach her. It was decided that Ryan should be arrested as soon as possible. Detectives didn't want to give him any opportunity to flee or dispose of potential evidence. Officers were dispatched to Ryan's place of employment and took him into custody that same day. Ryan insisted he was innocent. Yet during an interview with police, he finally conceded one thing.
同样显而易见的事实是，瑞恩正拼命地试图联系她。在整个面谈过程中，帕姆的手机一直收到她丈夫打来的电话和发来的信息，她的丈夫正疯狂地试图与她取得联系。最终决定必须尽快逮捕瑞恩。侦探们不想给他任何逃跑或销毁潜在证据的机会。警方派警员前往瑞恩的工作地点，并在当天将他拘留。瑞恩坚称自己是无辜的。然而，在接受警方盘问时，他最终承认了一件事。

64
00:52:57.000 --> 00:53:55.000
He said there had been an instance of quote, penetration between him and Gayle. He insisted it was entirely consensual. Investigators didn't believe this at all. Without Gayle alive to tell her side of the story, they could never know the full truth. But it seemed clear that she had been a victim of her older brother in more ways than one. The news that someone had been arrested for murdering Gayle and Rick Brink was what their families had long been hoping to hear. For the wine gardens, the relief felt upon hearing that the killer had been apprehended was marred by the fact that he was one of their own. Ryan and Gayle's mother refused to believe that her son could have killed her daughter.
他说，他和盖尔之间曾有过引用“插入”行为。他坚称这完全是双方自愿的。调查人员根本不相信这种说法。由于盖尔已经不在人世，无法讲述她这一侧的故事，他们永远无法得知全部的真相。但显而易见的是，她在多方面都成为了她亲哥哥的受害者。有人因谋杀盖尔和里克·布里姆而被捕的消息，正是他们家人长久以来一直期盼听到的。对于温加顿家族来说，得知凶手落网的那种如释重负感，却因为凶手是他们自己人而蒙上了阴影。瑞恩和盖尔的母亲拒绝相信她的儿子会杀害自己的女儿。

65
00:53:55.000 --> 00:54:52.000
But other members of the family accepted the news. Gayle had been particularly close to her older sister Cheryl. When she was alive, the two were best friends. In their last conversation together, Gayle had complained about the fact that Cheryl lived so far away from her. Cheryl received a call from the police alerting her to Ryan's arrest. They also informed her that Ryan had sexually assaulted Gayle throughout their childhood. On the TV show A Wedding and a Murder, Cheryl described how she felt literally sick to her stomach upon learning this. The thought that Gayle had kept the abuse to herself and suffered in silence for all those years was devastating.
但家族的其他成员接受了这个消息。盖尔和她的姐姐谢丽尔关系格外亲密。在她生前，两人是最好的朋友。在她们最后一次通话中，盖尔还曾抱怨谢丽尔离她住得太远。谢丽尔接到警方打来的电话，被告知瑞恩被捕了。他们还告知她，瑞恩在他们整个童年期间对盖尔实施了性侵。在电视节目《一场婚礼与一场谋杀》中，谢丽尔描述了她在得知这一消息时感到胃里一阵翻江倒海。一想到盖尔将虐待之事深埋心底，在长达数年的时间里默默承受痛苦，她就感到心碎欲绝。

66
00:54:52.000 --> 00:55:46.000
Cheryl believed that Gayle must not have told her because she'd known Cheryl would have confronted Ryan. Strange things that Ryan had said and done in the past slowly began to make sense. In one conversation, he mentioned how he'd gone through Gayle's personal papers after her death. He'd found some letters from men that he didn't want their parents to see, so he destroyed them. Shortly before Gayle and Rick's funeral, Ryan gave his own chilling rendition of the crime to Cheryl, wherein the killer walked down the hallway of the brink home before coming across Gayle in bed. It ended with the remark, You know, sometimes I wonder if I could have done this.
谢丽尔相信，盖尔一定是因为知道谢丽尔会去找瑞恩对质，所以才没有告诉她。瑞恩过去说过和做过的那些奇怪的事情，现在慢慢开始变得说得通了。在一次谈话中，他提到自己曾在盖尔死后翻看她的个人文件。他发现了一些他不希望他们父母看到的男人的信件，于是把它们销毁了。就在盖尔和里克葬礼前不久，瑞恩向谢丽尔冷酷地演绎了他自己版本的犯罪过程：凶手走过布里姆家的过廊，然后碰到了躺在床上的盖尔。故事以这样一句话结尾：“你知道的，有时候我在想，我是不是也能干出这种事。”

67
00:55:46.000 --> 00:56:31.000
Ryan had said something very similar to his aunt, Nava. At Gayle's funeral, he asked her, Do you think I could have killed them? Nava had received phone calls from both Ryan and Gayle the day before the murders. Gayle had complained that Ryan owed her money. Ryan was angry because Gayle was refusing to let their parents park their camper van in her driveway. They'd recently sold their home and were temporarily living in the camper. They'd initially parked it at Ryan's apartment building, but were soon instructed to move it as they were violating local ordinances.
瑞恩对他的姑姑娜瓦也说过类似的话。在盖尔的葬礼上，他问她：“你觉得我会不会杀了他们？”在谋杀案发生的头一天，娜瓦曾分别接到过瑞恩和盖尔的电话。盖尔曾抱怨瑞恩欠她钱。瑞恩则很生气，因为盖尔拒绝让他们的父母把房车停在她的车道上。他们最近刚卖了房子，暂时住在房车里。他们最初把房车停在瑞恩的公寓楼旁，但很快就被勒令移走，因为这违反了当地的条例。

68
00:56:31.000 --> 00:57:39.000
Ryan wanted them to go to Gayle's house, but she didn't like the idea. Ryan told his aunt that Gayle thought she was too good for their family. A little while later, after Gayle's death, Ryan told Nava that Gayle and Rick would probably still be alive if they'd let her parents stay on the property. On another occasion, he told his other sister, Lynn, that he wished he could apologize to Gayle because he felt as though he'd raped her. He said something almost identical to one of his nieces. He'd even discussed his sexual feelings for Gayle with his stepson. Ryan had described their relationship as touchy-feely, but said it was normal adolescent exploration. Ryan told his stepson that sometimes Gayle would say no, so he would force her.
瑞恩希望他们去盖尔家，但她并不喜欢这个主意。瑞恩对姑姑说，盖尔自以为了不起，看不起他们全家。过了一会儿，在盖尔死后，瑞恩对娜瓦说，如果盖尔和里克当初让他们的父母留在那里，他们现在可能还活着。在另一个场合，他告诉他的另一个姐姐琳娜，他希望能向盖尔道歉，因为他觉得自己强奸了她。他对其中一个侄女也说过几乎一模一样的话。他甚至还和继子讨论过他对盖尔的性欲望。瑞恩曾形容他们的关系是“动手动脚的”，但坚称这只是青春期的正常探索。瑞恩告诉继子，有时盖尔会说不，所以他就强迫了她。

69
00:57:39.000 --> 00:58:37.000
About 13 years after the murders, Cheryl had been chatting with Ryan on the phone. He mentioned how there had been a rodent in his yard, so, quote, I pulled out my 22 and shot it. Cheryl hadn't been aware that her brother owned a 22-gauge firearm, so she queried the statement. Ryan quickly corrected himself and said he'd used a different kind of gun, not a 22. In 2006, Cheryl and Ryan had a falling out. Their father had passed away and the fight related to veterans' benefits for their mother, Dorothea, who was now an elderly woman. They barely spoke in the years that followed. Then, all of a sudden, in October 2012, Ryan called Cheryl.
谋杀案发生大约13年后，谢丽尔曾在电话里和瑞恩闲聊。他提到院子里有一只啮齿动物，于是他引用说：“我掏出我的22口径枪把它给崩了。”谢丽尔并不知道她哥哥拥有一把.22口径的枪支，于是她对这种说法提出了质疑。瑞恩赶紧纠正自己，说他用的是另一种枪，不是.22口径的。2006年，谢丽尔和瑞恩闹翻了。他们的父亲去世了，而这场争执与他们当时已是老人的母亲多萝西娅的退伍军人津贴有关。在随后的几年里，他们几乎没有说过话。然后，就在2012年10月，瑞恩突然给谢丽尔打了个电话。

70
00:58:37.000 --> 00:59:37.000
He wanted to tell her that he'd forgiven her. What Cheryl didn't know was that Ryan and his wife Pam had just been interviewed by the cold case unit at the Ottawa County Sheriff's Department. Investigators finally had him in their sights. Following Ryan's arrest, detectives searched his home and found a 22 calibre rifle. But they never found the 22 revolver that had been used to kill Gale and Rick Brink. Pam told them she'd seen her husband place the same style of revolver in his car the day after the couple were murdered. Investigators concluded that Ryan had disposed of it somewhere, along with the clothing he'd been wearing that night. Investigators also compared Ryan's fingerprints to the ones recovered from a telephone and a toilet in the Brink home.
他想告诉她，他已经原谅她了。谢丽尔并不知道的是，瑞恩和他的妻子帕姆刚刚在渥太华县警长办公室接受了冷案调查组的面谈。调查人员终于将他锁定在视线之内。瑞恩被捕后，侦探搜查了他的住所，并找到了一支.22口径的步枪。但他们始终没有找到那把用来杀害盖尔和里克·布里姆的.22口径左轮手枪。帕姆告诉他们，这对夫妇被谋杀的第二天，她曾看到丈夫把同款的左轮手枪放进车里。调查人员断定，瑞恩一定把枪连同他当晚穿的衣服一起扔在某个地方了。调查人员还将瑞恩的指纹与从布里姆家的一部电话和一个马桶上提取到的指纹进行了比对。

71
00:59:37.000 --> 01:00:39.000
Neither were a match. But, despite the lack of physical evidence tying Ryan to the crime, they were certain they finally had their killer. Ryan Weingarten was charged with two counts of first degree murder. His trial began in March 2014 at the Ottawa County Circuit Court in Grand Haven, Michigan. The prosecution was arguing that Ryan had murdered his sister and her husband because he was scared Gale would reveal his incestuous abuse of her. The killings were also motivated by jealousy. He resented Gale and Rick's success. The prosecution had no physical evidence, but they did have 60 witnesses who were willing to testify. Chief among them was Ryan's wife, Pam.
两者并不相符。但是，尽管缺乏将瑞恩与该罪行直接联系起来的物证，他们仍然确信自己终于抓住了真凶。瑞恩·温加顿被指控两项一级谋杀罪。他的审判于2014年3月在密歇根州大黑文的渥太华县巡回法院开始。检方的论点是，瑞恩谋杀姐姐和姐夫是因为他害怕盖尔会揭发他对她实施的乱伦虐待。这起谋杀案也是出于嫉妒的动机。他嫉妒盖尔和里克的成功。检方虽然没有物证，但他们有60位愿意出庭作证的证人。其中最主要的证人就是瑞恩的妻子帕姆。

72
01:00:39.000 --> 01:01:37.000
She looked scared as she took the stand, but spoke clearly and firmly about the things Ryan had said and done. Pam denied ever feeling pressured to turn state's witness against her husband. Instead, she said any pressure she experienced was due entirely to her own conscience. It was difficult for her to testify, especially when Ryan began shouting abuse at her from his seat at the defendants table. At one point, he called her a black-hearted evil woman and added, I can't believe you're saying all these lies about me, Pam. The judge had him removed from the courtroom. As well as detailing how Ryan had taken her to look at Gale and Rick's bodies, Pam described what life had been like with him.
她走上证人席时显得很害怕，但语气清晰坚定，讲述了瑞恩说过的话和做过的事。帕姆否认自己曾感到任何压力去充当指证丈夫的控方证人。相反，她表示她感受到的任何压力完全来自于她自己的良心。对她来说作证非常困难，特别是当瑞恩在被告席座位上开始对她大喊大叫、进行辱骂时。有一度，她被骂作“黑心恶毒的女人”，瑞恩还补充道：“帕姆，我真不敢相信你在说这些关于我的谎言。”法官下令将他逐出法庭。除了详细讲述瑞恩如何带她去看盖尔和里克的尸体外，帕姆还描述了和他生活在一起的日子是什么样的。

73
01:01:37.000 --> 01:02:35.000
Ryan had been controlling and abusive. He hadn't allowed her to have friends of her own. Pam's father had also been emotionally abusive, and she thought that must be why Ryan was able to so successfully manipulate her. After his arrest, he started sending Pam a barrage of letters. Sometimes, he begged her to go back on her statement. Other times, he threatened her with God's wrath for going against him. In total, he sent 29 of these letters while he was on remand. A fellow inmate claimed that while Ryan was in custody awaiting trial, he'd boasted about committing the double homicide. According to this individual, Ryan also ranted about one of his other sisters, Cheryl.
瑞恩一直是个控制欲强且有虐待倾向的人。他不允许她有自己的朋友。帕姆的父亲也有情感虐待倾向，她认为这一定就是瑞恩能够如此成功地操控她的原因。他被捕后，开始给帕姆发狂轰滥炸般的信件。有时，他哀求她推翻自己的供词。有时，他又用上帝的愤怒来威胁她，责怪她与他作对。在候审期间，他总共寄出了29封这样的信件。一名同监狱的犯人声称，瑞恩在被拘留等待审判期间，曾吹嘘自己犯下了这起双重谋杀案。据这名个人所述，瑞恩还大骂了他的另一个姐姐谢丽尔。

74
01:02:35.000 --> 01:03:33.000
He was furious at her because over the past 20 years, she'd constantly campaigned for law enforcement to solve Gale and Rick's murder. Ryan supposedly said to the other inmate, If I'd known she was going to cause me trouble like this, I would have killed that bitch a long time ago. Then, he mimed choking a person with his hands. The inmate testified at Ryan's trial in exchange for three years being taken off his own sentence. Ryan's defense team argued that the prisoner had a history of turning snitch when it benefited him. Ryan was pleading not guilty. In an attempt to argue for his innocence, the defense pointed at other possible suspects.
他极其愤怒，因为在过去的20年里，谢丽尔一直在不断呼吁执法部门侦破盖尔和里克的谋杀案。据说瑞恩对这名狱友说：“如果我知道她会给我惹来这样的麻烦，我早就把那个贱人给做掉了。”接着，他还用双手做出了掐一个人的动作。这名狱友在瑞恩的审判中作证，条件是为他自己的刑期减刑三年。瑞恩的辩护团队辩称，这名犯人有在对己有利时充当告密者的历史。瑞恩作了无罪抗辩。为了证明自己无罪，辩护方将矛头指向了其他潜在嫌疑人。

75
01:03:33.000 --> 01:04:48.000
They suggested Gale and Rick had been murdered by a biker gang who mistook Rick for shotgun Sid, the drug dealing former owner of their property. They also theorized that Gale had been targeted by a colleague after she started investigating possible financial irregularities at work. They claimed there had been a file from Gale's work at the crime scene, but it was removed before it could be looked into. An official from the company where Gale was employed said he had gone to the house after learning of Gale's murder, but denied taking or asking police for any documents. The prosecution dismissed the suggestion that Gale was executed by a workmate as little green men from Mars stuff. Ryan Weingarten testified in his own defense. His testimony was rambling and often irrelevant as he went off on strange tangents. Several times, the judge had to remind Ryan and his attorney to stay on track.
他们暗示盖尔和里克是被一个飞车帮谋杀的，对方把里克误认成了他们房产的前任毒贩房东“霰弹枪西德”。他们还推测，盖尔在开始调查工作中的可能财务违规行为后，成为了某位同事的目标。他们声称案发现场有一份来自盖尔工作单位的文件，但在被调查之前就被拿走了。盖尔受雇公司的官员表示，在得知盖尔被谋杀后他曾去过那所房子，但否认拿走或要求警察提供任何文件。检方对盖尔被同事处决的说法不屑一顾，斥其为“火星来的小绿人”般的无稽之谈。瑞恩·温加顿为自己进行了无罪辩护。他的证词东拉西扯、毫无逻辑，经常扯到一些奇怪的题外话上。法官数次不得不提醒瑞恩和他的律师切入正题。

76
01:04:48.000 --> 01:05:59.000
Under cross-examination, Ryan was grilled about his relationship with Gale. Despite earlier admitting to police that he'd once had sex with his sister, Ryan now claimed he'd only said that under duress. He was adamant that there had only been three incidents with Gale that could be perceived as sexual. These incidents involved comparing their bodies after bathing and touching and groping while clothed. As prosecutors continued to pursue this line of questioning, Ryan became increasingly upset, stating, You guys are making it into a mockery and you need a motive and there is no motive. He began to cry and questioned why his sister Cheryl and wife Pam had both testified against him. He accused investigators of convincing Pam to lie and compared footage of her police interviews to a wolf pack chewing on an innocent lamb.
在交叉盘问中，瑞恩就他与盖尔的关系接受了严厉盘问。尽管此前曾向警方承认他曾与姐姐发生过性关系，但瑞恩现在声称他当时只是在胁迫下才那样说的。他坚认他和盖尔之间只有三次可以被视为与性有关的事件。这些事件包括洗澡后比较体形，以及在穿着衣服的情况下进行触摸和抚摸。随着公诉人继续穷追猛打这一系列问题，瑞恩变得越来越激动，他宣称：“你们这是在把这事当成儿戏，你们需要一个动机，但根本没有什么动机。”他开始哭泣，并质问为什么他的姐姐谢丽尔和妻子帕姆都要出庭指证他。他指责调查人员说服帕姆撒谎，并把她接受警方采访的录像比作“狼群在撕咬一只无辜的小羔羊”。

77
01:05:59.000 --> 01:06:45.000
And then he suddenly said out of nowhere, Do I feel like I deserve to sue the county? Oh, absolutely. Ryan also denied being jealous of Gale and Rick's success. He loved his sister. She helped him out by co-signing a car loan for him and making one of his payments. He also said he had a good relationship with his brother-in-law. Ryan liked Rick's dry sense of humour and found him to be a super nice person. Ryan maintained that on the night of the murders, he and Pam had done laundry and babysat for a friend.
然后他突然没头没脑地说了一句：“我觉得我配起诉这个县吗？哦，绝对配。”瑞恩还否认自己嫉妒盖尔和里克的成功。他很爱他的姐姐。她曾为他的汽车贷款共同署名并替他代还了一笔款项，以此来帮他。他还说自己和姐夫的关系很好。瑞恩很喜欢里克冷面笑匠式的幽默感，觉得他是个超级好的人。瑞恩坚称在谋杀案当晚，他和帕姆一直在洗衣服并帮朋友带孩子。

78
01:06:45.000 --> 01:07:32.000
He denied ever going out by himself. In fact, he said that Pam had gone out for drinks with a friend and returned home at about 2am. Ryan said that on the afternoon of Sunday, November 22, he was running low on petrol and cigarettes, so he stopped at a service station. He used the opportunity to try to call Gale from a pay phone. He had been planning to discuss the issue of their parents' camper van with her. Ryan was angry that Gale wouldn't let them park it at her property, but denied wanting to kill her over the matter. Ryan dialed Gale's number. No one answered the phone.
他否认自己曾独自外出。事实上，他说帕姆是和一个朋友出去喝酒，直到凌晨2点才回家。瑞恩说，在11月22日星期日的下午，他的汽油和香烟都快用完了，于是他在一个加油站停了下来。他借此机会试图从公用电话给盖尔打个电话。他本打算和她讨论父母房车的问题。瑞恩很生气盖尔不让他们把房车停在她家房产上，但否认想因此杀害她。瑞恩拨通了盖尔的电话。没有人接听电话。

79
01:07:32.000 --> 01:08:20.000
He decided to go over to Pam's house instead. He claimed that he first learned of Gale and Rick's murders at 5pm on Monday, November 23 after he went over to his brother's house. Later that evening, Ryan headed over to Pam's house. She was watching the news and a story came on about the double murder. That was my sister and Rick, Ryan told her. Then he lay down on Pam's bed while sobbing. They killed my sister. On March 28, 2014, the jury delivered their verdict.
于是他决定改去帕姆家。他声称自己是在11月23日星期一晚上5点去哥哥家时，才第一次得知盖尔和里克被谋杀的。那天晚些时候，瑞恩前往帕姆家。她当时正在看新闻，正好播报了一则关于这起双重谋杀案的报道。“那是我的姐姐和里克，”瑞恩对她说。然后他躺在帕姆的床上痛哭起来。“他们杀了我姐姐。”2014年3月28日，陪审团作出了裁决。

80
01:08:20.000 --> 01:09:03.000
They found Ryan Weingarten, now 51 years old, guilty of murdering Gale and Rick Brink. Ryan kept his head down as the verdict was read aloud. As he was escorted from the courtroom, he said, I didn't do this. Most members of the victim's family's welcomed the verdict. Outside court, Gale's sister Cheryl told reporters, We're done. We finally got him. He created this situation and now he has to pay for it.
他们裁定现年51岁的瑞恩·温加顿谋杀盖尔和里克·布里姆的罪名成立。宣读判决书时，瑞恩一直低着头。当他被押出法庭时，他说道：“我没有干这事。”受害者家属的大多数成员对这一判决表示欢迎。法院门外，盖尔的姐姐谢丽尔对记者说：“我们解脱了。我们终于抓到他了。这一切都是他造成的，现在他必须为此付出代价。”

81
01:09:03.000 --> 01:09:53.000
Cheryl explained that although she still loved her brother, she hated who he had become and what he did. The pain of losing her sister had tormented her for almost 30 years. Rick's brother, Bud Brink, told news outlet M Live, We are extremely pleased to have the justice my brother deserves. At least this gives us some closure as to how it happened and why it happened. Although he said he wished Pam had come forward with the truth decades earlier, he appreciated her strength in finally doing so, adding, It took a lot for her to come forward.
谢丽尔解释说，尽管她依然爱她的哥哥，但她恨他现在的样子以及他所做的事。失去姐姐的痛苦折磨了她将近30年。里克的弟弟巴德·布里姆对新闻媒体M Live表示：“我们极其高兴能为我哥哥讨回他应得的正义。这至少让我们对事情是如何发生的以及为什么发生有了一个了结。”尽管他说他希望帕姆能早几十年站出来说出真相，但他对她最终站出来的坚强表示赞赏，并补充道：“她能站出来付出了巨大的勇气。”

82
01:09:53.000 --> 01:10:49.000
Ryan's sentencing took place almost a month later. When he was given the opportunity to speak, he ranted and raved for an hour. At times, he stared tearfully up at the ceiling and addressed God directly, saying, Lord, why are you doing this to me? I'm a good man. Why? Why is this happening? When it was time for his sentence to be delivered, Ryan constantly interrupted the judge. Finally, the judge lost his patience and asked, Do I need to bind you and gag you, sir? We'll have the deputies go and duct tape you if that's what's necessary, but you're going to listen. He described the murders as a brutal execution and said Ryan was a brutal cold-blooded murderer
瑞恩的宣判在一个月后进行。当他获得发言机会时，他大声咆哮了整整一个小时。有时，他含泪凝视着天花板，直接对上帝喊话：“主啊，你为什么要对我做这种事？我是个好人。为什么？为什么会发生这种事？”轮到宣判时，瑞恩不断打断法官的话。最终，法官失去了耐心，问道：“先生，我需要把你捆起来再塞住嘴吗？如果真有必要，我们会让警员用强力胶带把你粘起来，但你必须给我听着。”他将谋杀案描述为一场残忍的处刑，并称瑞恩是一个冷血残酷的杀人犯，

83
01:10:49.000 --> 01:11:45.000
before sentencing him to two life sentences with no possibility of parole. Most were pleased with this conclusion, with the exception of Gail and Ryan's mother, Dorothea. She didn't believe her son was guilty. She was overheard telling one investigator, I don't care what you say, you're wrong. Ryan Weingarten subsequently appealed his conviction at three different courts, including Michigan's Supreme Court. He lost all three appeals and remains incarcerated. Pam has divorced him. In December 2016, a former Ottawa County Sheriff declared the murder of Deborah Wilson solved.
随后判处他两项终身监禁且不得假释。除了盖尔和瑞恩的母亲多萝西娅之外，大多数人对这个结果都感到满意。她不相信自己的儿子有罪。有人听到她对一名调查人员说：“我不管你们怎么说，你们都错了。”此后，瑞恩·温加顿向包括密歇根州最高法院在内的三个不同法院对自己的定罪提起了上诉。他的三次上诉全部驳回，目前仍在服刑中。帕姆已经与他离婚。2016年12月，渥太华县前警长宣布黛博拉·威尔逊谋杀案告破。

84
01:11:45.000 --> 01:12:49.000
Deborah had been murdered in December 1987 and investigators had initially wondered whether her killing could be connected to the Brink case. Prior to reopening the Brink investigation, cold case detectives had been looking at Deborah's case. They honed in on an acquaintance of Deborah's who was connected to the murder via some suspicious photographs. Unfortunately, he died before he could be arrested and charged, but detectives remained certain he was responsible. Deborah's family received a detailed briefing about the suspect and the case is now closed. The 1977 murder of Deborah Polinski, which was also looked at during the original Brink investigation, remains open. Detectives from the cold case unit at the Ottawa County Sheriff's Department continue to investigate the case.
黛博拉于1987年12月被谋杀，调查人员最初曾怀疑她的遇害是否与布里姆案有关。在重新启动布里姆案调查之前，冷案侦探们一直在调查黛博拉的案子。他们将目标锁定在黛博拉的一个熟人身上，此人通过一些可疑的照片与谋杀案联系在了一起。不幸的是，他在被捕和起诉前就去世了，但侦探们确信他难辞其咎。黛博拉的家人收到了关于该嫌疑人的详细案情通报，目前该案已告结。1987年黛博拉·波林斯基谋杀案（在最初调查布里姆案时也曾被审视过）目前依然悬而未决。渥太华县警长办公室冷案调查组的侦探们仍在继续调查此案。

85
01:12:49.000 --> 01:12:54.000
Those who knew Gail and Rick Brink have spoken of their sorrow at losing two wonderful people. In the television program A Wedding and a Murder, a friend of Rick's described the double homicide as a loss to their community and the future. He was saddened that they never got the chance to be parents, saying, I can't imagine anything but Rick being the best dad in the world, and I can't imagine Gail being anyone but the most fun mum in the world. Gail's sister Cheryl says she thinks about Gail just about every day, quote, She'll flicker through my mind. It's not always sad because she was actually a very funny person and we had a great time together. But you don't forget. That's how you keep their memory alive. There aren't comments yet for this episode. Click on any sentence in the transcript to leave a comment.
那些认识盖尔和里克·布里姆的人纷纷表达了失去两个优秀之人的悲痛。在电视节目《一场婚礼与一场谋杀》中，里克的一位朋友将这起双重谋杀案形容为他们社区和未来的损失。他感到难过的是，他们两人从未有机会成为父母，并说道：“我无法想象里克会不是世界上最好的爸爸，我也无法想象盖尔会不是世界上最有趣的妈妈。”盖尔的姐姐谢丽尔说她几乎每天都会想起盖尔，她引述道：“她会在我的脑海中一闪而过。这并不总是悲伤的，因为她其实是一个非常有趣的人，我们曾度过了一段美好的时光。但你不会忘记。这就是你如何让他们的记忆永远活下去的方式。”本集暂无评论。点击转写文本中的任意句子即可发表评论。
